      "en": "$tin_PersTC_amt"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "This is the annual amount (currently €2,000) of the basic Personal Tax Credit that every Irish resident taxpayer receives against income tax liability, matching 'Personal Tax Credit: non-refundable' in the taxes theme doc's credit list (amount not given there). It is used twice in tin_ie's ArithOp formula ('Personal tax credit (can be shared)'), reflecting that for jointly assessed married couples the credit can be allocated or split between spouses."
    },
